                                "sense_id": "efece09e-009a-34aa-9918-75f08fffafb2",
                                "text": "\"Mair'd be a bother; an' I doot not ye'll mak' it all richt, lad.\""
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "e4c8e776-af12-3828-9773-3fbdcb620cc3",
                        "entry_id": "17ca55a0-916e-34d0-bd8e-d00d2943843f",
